# Changelog
All notable changes to Example Widgets will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]
### Added
- Dark mode for the widget picker.

## [2.1.0] - 2026-09-14
### Added
- Widgets can now be pinned to the top of a dashboard.

### Fixed
- Resizing a widget no longer resets its refresh interval.

## [2.0.1] - 2026-08-02 [YANKED]
### Fixed
- Faster dashboard loading. Pulled because it broke widget ordering for some users.

## [2.0.0] - 2026-07-20
### Changed
- Dashboards are now shared per team instead of per user.

### Removed
- The legacy XML export. Use the JSON export instead.

## [1.4.0] - 2026-03-03
### Added
- CSV export for chart widgets.

